CAT-PD Self-Harm. Each alert column is \code{TRUE} when its scale's rounded T
score is at least \code{alert_t}, \code{FALSE} when it is lower, and \code{NA} when the
T score is \code{NA}. The default of 65 is the alert point Katherine Jonas,
the battery manual's first author, gave in her email to the package
maintainer of 2026-10-15. She added that clinics may set another, for
example to suit their state's laws.

